§0 PURPOSE
  goal := one coherent apocky.com + one truthful public Apocrypha conversation doorway
    + one bounded path from current state adaptation to genuine shadow weight-learning.

  success :=
    S1 route-law exact: each public URL has one carrier, one purpose, one truth claim.
    S2 visible-control law: every control works end-to-end or is absent; no interactive-looking stubs.
    S3 public Apocrypha: verified-account member completes isolated, consented, idempotent turn;
       owner console remains private and separate.
    S4 visual outcome: clear hierarchy + readable type + collision-free responsive layouts
       + keyboard/screen-reader/zoom/contrast/reduced-motion proof.
    S5 learning outcome: one rights-clean, lease-bound, shadow-only instruction candidate produces
       checkpoint+evaluation+rollback receipts; serving remains unchanged until separate promotion.
    S6 deployment outcome: preview→canary→production probes pass against actual Vercel+Apocv2 runtime;
       rollback is rehearsed before promotion.

  non-goals :=
    N! generic chatbot aesthetic.
    N! anonymous unbounded inference.
    N! public conversation auto-training.
    N! owner endpoint relabeled public.
    N! presence/avatar rendered as Apocrypha-authored without current display authority.
    N! learning plan interpreted as optimizer, serving, promotion, deployment, or release authority.

